(text "SENSOR WIRING NOTES" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 129.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7624cde6-08d1-4102-a7a1-e9e733b412f3"))
(text "Pressure: 0.5-4.5 V ratiometric; 10k/20k divider scales 4.5 V to 3.0 V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 133.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0d4c193d-523b-4035-8078-cae8dbb8cf85"))
(text "Silk GND / 5V / SIG = pins 1 / 2 / 3. Amazon 3-wire: black=1, red=2, yellow or green=3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 136.800 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c0716de7-830a-4eb6-afdb-713199e75378"))
(text "Load cells: silk E+ E- A+ A- (red / black / green / white). Swap A+/A- if the reading is negative." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 140.600 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "49fc27c5-5d08-434a-a231-2874025da4d9"))
(text "5-wire load cells: no shield pin on the terminal; tie the shield to E- at one end only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 144.400 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "20b4c9c5-f4bd-4497-8415-5a84f58aeaff"))
(text "Thermocouples: silk T+ (pin 1) / T- (pin 2). Type is set in firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 148.200 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f98db651-3b80-4961-b932-3e3663c85b6c"))
(text "Firmware config.yaml is type K. ANSI type K: yellow + (pin 1) / red - (pin 2)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 152.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "749f693c-5cd7-42f7-a35b-e6db144241fb"))
(text "Keep sensor wiring away from valve wiring; use twisted/shielded pairs for TCs and load cells." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 155.800 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7b989cb8-2702-4d71-8639-2459236ee1c5"))
(text "TM1637 displays: pin 1 is +5 V. Teensy 4.1 CLK/DIO pins are not 5 V tolerant." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 159.600 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6f28f28a-ecf8-41b6-b805-6b4462c1c3e3"))
(text "If a 5 V module pulls CLK/DIO up to 5 V, that can damage the Teensy." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 163.400 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0092f159-baa3-47a1-b2c3-5a60a0c34e3e"))
(text "Prefer 3.3 V modules, or run the display VCC at 3.3 V if they stay bright enough." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 222.000 167.200 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7408d17f-bccf-4a91-9cca-01a130879e09"))
